      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Magic-angle graphene revealed a controllable platform for striking correlated and topological quantum states in a designer material.",
        "attribution": "Bistritzer and MacDonald supplied the key theoretical prediction, and Jarillo-Herrero led the experimental discovery.",
        "maturity": "The central observations have stimulated extensive replication and a broad moiré-materials field.",
        "uncertainties": [
